    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Creativity is an aspect of God’s character and nature. His creative nature is portrayed in two ways. Firstly, through the spoken word (Psalm 33:6, Hebrews 11:3). Secondly, through wisdom (Jer. 10:15, 51:15). When man was created in the image of God, he was blessed with God’s creative nature. Man’s creative abilities and power of invention are from God."
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Ideas rule the world and they are the most expensive commodities on the earth. One creative idea from God can turn things around for you. If you are a true Christian, your words carry creative powers. (Eccl. 8:4). You can see what you say. Again, you have the mind of Christ (creative wisdom of Gods) and you can use it at any time. From today, begin to walk in your creative abilities in Jesus Name!!"
