   "summary": "Jesus Christ is not only your Saviour, He is also your Lord.",
   "key_scripture": "Genesis 18:3",
   "key_scripture_text": "And said, My Lord, if now I have found favour in thy sight, pass not away, I pray thee, from thy servant",
