     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Listen to me today, no matter what is lacking in your life, God can provide. When man ends, God begins . When man says it is over, God takes over and when God takes over, the battle is over. If God is truly your shepherd, you will never want any good thing (Psalm 23:1). Phil. 4:19 says that your God will supply all your needs...” The economic situation notwithstanding, God will always provide for you and your family. May Heaven surprise you today in Jesus Name! God will connect you to good things and open great doors for you. From today, goodness and mercy shall follow you all the days of your life."
