   "summary": "We live in a world full of turmoil and chaos. Anxiety and worry are common occurrences in the lives of most people. In spite of all these, God can give us total peace. The currency of the Blood of Jesus purchased for us among other things our peace.",
   "key_scripture": "Colossians 1:20-22",
