     "text": "Peace simply means freedom from war; a state of mental calm and serenity, with no anxiety. The covenant of peace between man and God has its roots in the Blood of Jesus. This means that without the Cross, there could be no access by a sinful man to a holy God. Through the fall of Adam, man was constantly at war with God. There was a gap between man and God. Sin created a partition between divinity and humanity but the cross became that bridge that reconnected man to God."
    },
