     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Ephesians 2:14 says of Jesus Christ, “For He is our peace, who hath made both one, and hath broken down the MIDDLE WALL OF PARTITION between us”, that is why you can now have true fellowship with your Father in heaven. Hebrews 10:19 also says, “Having therefore, brethren, boldness to enter into the holiest by the BLOOD of Jesus............”"
    },
