     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Friend, do you really know Jesus? Are you a partaker of the peace in His Blood? Are you enjoying that peace that the Cross has given you? It is yours. Begin to enjoy absolute peace from today on the basis of the Blood of Jesus. The Blood of Christ is your only true source of peace in this chaotic world. Isaiah 57:21 says, ‘There is no peace, saith my God, to the wicked.’"
