     "text": "Every sin that is not dealt with has power to deal with the sinner. Stop toying with sin otherwise, you will become a toy in the hands of the devil. There are things you must stop today or you will never have another opportunity to stop them. Stop that sin before it stops you from enjoying the best that God has for you. Is it fornication, masturbation, alcoholism, pornography, pride, anger, theft, unforgiveness, abortion etc? The Blood is powerful enough to cleanse you from every sin. (1 John 1:7). You can win the battle against sin through the Blood of Jesus."
