   "order": 24,
   "title": "The Road to Total Freedom!",
   "summary": "Most people in our world today are bound in one area of their lives or the other. However, Every bondage terminates at the Blood of Jesus!",
   "key_scripture": "Zechariah 9:11",
   "key_scripture_text": "As for thee also, BY THE BLOOD of thy covenant I have sent forth by prisoners all of the pit wherein there is no water”.",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Most people in our world today are bound in one area of their lives or the other. However, Every bondage terminates at the Blood of Jesus! As we see in Exodus, every miracle and sign was performed, every effort was made by God through Moses, to free Israel from Egyptian bondage, but until the blood was introduced (Exodus 12), there was no freedom for them. The Blood is God’s last resort, God’s last card for man’s total freedom."
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "The revelation here is that, after the introduction of the blood, Moses never said again, “Let my people go!” Rather it was Pharaoh who now frantically and desperately wanted them gone. Psalm 105:38 says “Egypt (Pharaoh and his people) was glad when they (the Israelites) departed: for the fear of them fell upon them”. The Blood can so much instill fear in satan and his cohorts to the extent that they will beg you to have your freedom. From today, the forces that have held you now will beg you to go in Jesus Name!"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "No force or power in hell can resist the Blood of Jesus! You’ll never be free from your oppressions without the application of the Blood of Jesus. Come on now! Rise and begin to claim your freedom from the enemies of sickness, poverty, sin, disappointment, and unending struggles on the basis of the Blood of Jesus."
    },
