    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "When sheep go astray, it takes a loving and a caring shepherd to go after the one that was lost and bring it back into the fold. In the same way, we were once lost and it took the loving and caring shepherd of our souls (Jesus Christ to bring us back to the fold of God. Again, sheep can experience severe hunger especially when there is no pasture. Such severe hunger can cause death among them. A good shepherd therefore will always lead the sheep to a green pasture so that they don’t starve to death."
