     "text": "As a plant must be rooted in a soil for it to flourish, so a man can only succeed when he is rooted and grounded in God. It was said of Abraham Lincoln that one of the most his important prayers he prayed as the President of the United States of America was ‘Lord, without You I MUST FAIL.’ Yes! Without God, you are programmed to fail and condemned to lose! Man was created as a vessel to contain God and without God, you are empty."
