     "text": "His only means of ever getting blessings was for that ‘Personality’ to bless him. That is exactly what God wants. God wants to bring you to a point and time where you cannot achieve anything apart from Him. Jacob lost his strength; he needed another to enrich and bless him. His life was useless to him if the man didn’t bless him."
