     "text": "But you have to position yourself well to see well. Rev.4:1 says, ‘1 ¶ After these things I looked, and behold, a door standing open in heaven. And the first voice which I heard was like a trumpet speaking with me, saying, “Come up here, and I will show you things which must take place after this.”"
    },
