     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "not depart out of thy mouth but thou shall meditate on it day and night...’. You must be addicted to the Word. Always carry your Bible around you and empty its deposits into your heart. Always live by the standards of the Word of God."
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "3. Wait on God in fasting: Fasting is the accelerator pedal of prayer."
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "As you learn the art of waiting on God, you will end as a heavy- weight in the spirit. Paul was a fervent in the spirit because he loved to fast. 2 Corinthians 11:27, ‘ In weariness and painfulness, in watchings often, in hunger and thirst, in fastings often , in cold and nakedness.’"
