     "text": "Every Christian is appointed by God as a qualified and a certified watchman over the souls of men. Ezekiel 3:17-18 says, “Son of man, I have made thee a watchman unto the house of Israel: therefore hear the word at my mouth, and give them warning from me. When I say unto the wicked, Thou shalt surely die; and thou givest him not warning, nor speakest to warn the wicked man he shall die in his iniquity; but HIS BLOOD WILL I REQUIRE AT THINE HAND”. Right here is a “Murder Charge ” against anyone who does not win souls. Since no murderer shall inherit the kingdom of Heaven, you must beware. The responsibilities of the souls of men have been entrusted into the hands of every believer ."
    },
