     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "When Paul met Jesus on the road to Damascus, the first question he asked was “ ...,Lord, what wilt thou have me to do?.......” Unlike Paul, a new convert will start by asking Jesus, “Lord, what will You do for me?” Clear case of misplaced priorities! No wonder we are suffering. The first commandment of Jesus to His disciples was evangelism (Matthew 4:19) and the last commandment was evangelism (Matt. 28:19-20)."
    },
