     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Archibald Brown said, the Gospel is a fact therefore tell it simply . The Gospel is a joyful fact, therefore tell it cheerfully. It is an entrusted fact; therefore, tell it faithfully, It is a fact of the infinite moment; therefore preach Christ” . Share the Word! One person at a time and we would change this world for Jesus! No more silence! Speak up for Jesus! Plunder hell to populate Heaven!"
