     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Those who were invited for the feast in Luke 14 began to MAKE EXCUSES. Excuses are made; they are not real. Never hold on to your excuses if you really want to excel in life. THE EASIEST WAY TO TRAP YOUR DESTINY IS TO HOLD ON TO YOUR EXCUSES! Your background should never be the grounds for your failure. You can make it no matter what!"
