     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Jealousy is the CANCER OF THE SPIRIT, the JAUNDICE OF THE SOUL and the BREAKER OF THE BODY! In life, it is not just what you are eating but also WHAT IS EATING YOU UP!"
