     "text": "t is one thing to experience significant suffering and to see with hindsight what God has done and how he has used it for good. It’s far more thrilling when we begin to allow God to use the suffering in our lives even while we are in the midst of it. God does not want to wait until everything is perfect in your life to begin to use you. He wants you to be fruitful right now even in the midst of your pain and suffering."
