     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "One of the greatest qualities you MUST possess as a person is the WILL TO DO WHAT IS RIGHT EVEN WHEN IT IS HARD AND DIFFICULT. Count on it, the day will come when ‘progress and success’ call for compromising your convictions and principles. The day will surely come when you will be tempted to break and bend the rules in return for a favour! In such moments, what hangs in the balance is your INNER STRENGTH & FORTITUDE!"
