     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "For instance, when we mention the name of Joseph, the Bible character, you associate it with self-control and the fear of God. However, when we mention the name of another famous Bible character, Samson, you associate it to sexual immorality. Usually, once we are intoxicated by success, we start to believe that the rules don’t apply to us! We begin to think that the principles of the Bible no longer hold true in our lives."
