     "text": "Every Samson who’s laid with a Delilah, every David who committed adultery with a Bathsheba and later betrayed his Uriah, every Judas who sold out his Jesus began his downfall with a THOUGHT. Your thought is the exact measure of your life; no one gets better than his or her THOUGHT LIFE - Proverbs 23:7 says, “...as he thinketh in his heart, so is he”"
