     "text": "One wise man said, ‘Sow a thought, reap an act; sow an act, reap a habit; sow a habit, reap a character; sow a character, reap a destiny. From today, decide to align your thoughts with GOD’S WORD! The RENEWAL OF YOUR MIND is the starting point of your TRANSFORMATION –"
