  {
   "slug": "you-shall-experience-a-change-of-story",
   "order": 86,
   "title": "You Shall Experience a Change of Story",
   "summary": "One of these days, you will wake up in the robes of a king in Jesus Name! What you must remember is that in every pain, there is a hidden gain. The challenges of life must never cause you to give up.",
   "key_scripture": "Genesis 41:41",
   "key_scripture_text": "And Pharaoh said unto Joseph, see, I have set thee over all the Lord of Egypt”.",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "One of these days, you will wake up in the robes of a king in Jesus Name! What you must remember is that in every pain, there is a hidden gain. The challenges of life must never cause you to give up. Whenever you are down to nothing, God is surely up to something. In world today, most Christians are looking for slight things to backslide."
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Look at the story of Joseph critically. Many Christians of today would easily backslide if they are to experience what this young man went through. Joseph was a dreamer. In fact, all the dreams pointed to one fact “that one day he will be a ruler and a great man”. However, what he went through did not look at it all. His own brothers conspired and sold him as a slave to the Israelites and he finally landed in Egypt. In Egypt, Potiphar’s wife again put him into trouble which landed him into prison. My God, how can a “future ruler” become a “present prisoner?”"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
